@baseUrl = http://localhost:5041
@origin = http://localhost:5173

### 1. Register Customer Baru (Otomatis dapat role CUSTOMER & Wallet Rp0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sugeng Sanjaya",
  "username": "sugeng.sanjaya",
  "email": "sugeng12@gmail.com",
  "phoneNumber": "082347711777",
  "password": "Sugeng@1234"
}

### 2. Login sebagai CUSTOMER (Seeded User: Rizal - Wallet W001)
# @name loginCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rizal@example.com",
  "password": "Customer@123"
}

### 3. Login sebagai ADMIN (Sesuaikan password dengan User Secrets Seed:AdminPassword)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ewallet.com",
  "password": "AdminEwallet@123"
}

### 4. Cek Identitas Sesi Aktif - CUSTOMER (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCustomer.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 5. Cek Identitas Sesi Aktif - ADMIN (/auth/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 6. Refresh Token (Otomatis menggunakan cookie ewallet_refresh dari login terakhir)
# @name refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Origin: {{origin}}
Accept: application/json

### 7. Logout (Revoke token family & hapus cookie ewallet_refresh)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}
Accept: application/json